# Everything under data/ is generated by `make demo` and fully reproducible:
# ~6MB of H.264, ~3MB of VP9, and a 1MB ground-truth dump. Committing the
# tracks without the clip they were computed from would also leave the repo in
# a state where the two disagree after any pipeline change.
